  "limits": [
    "A model, not a surveyed highway route: shortest path over an OpenStreetMap extract of highways (about 41,500 km of road, no road names or classes in the file, no one-way rules). Local roads are not in it. If local roads counted as a 'highway route', a district whose nearest corner has no highway could be closer than the model says: Rocky Mountain House-Banff Park is only about 105 km away in a straight line, so its 165 km rests on the road model. Lesser Slave Lake is under 150 km on the model and no reading that adds roads can lengthen a shortest path.",
